<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If you are thirsty, He’s heard your cry.</l><l>He is a fountain that will not run dry.</l><l>He’s quenching our longings, we’re satisfied,</l><l>Just eating and drinking the risen Lord!</l><l>Yes, that is why He died;</l><l>So He could become the Spirit, get into us,</l><l>Fill all our being—Oh, how glorious!</l><l>It’s really so simple—just take and eat;</l><l>That’s all you have to do.</l><l>Come enjoy the Lord Jesus.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
